---
layout: "layouts/content.njk"
title: Plays
description: The Child Welfare Playbook provides strategies (or “plays”) to help connect children to families, reduce time in foster care, and improve outcomes. Each play includes how to run it, examples of it in action, and related resources.
pagefind:
  type: Page
tags:
  - noTopic
---

<div class="plays-list-wrapper l-stack-basic">
{%- for topic in collections.topics -%}
{% unless topic.url == false %}

<div class="plays-list" id="{{ topic.data.id }}">
<div class="play-list-meta">
  {% if topic.data.icon %} {% icon topic.data.icon %}{% endif %}

  <h2>{{ topic.data.title }}</h2>

  <p>{{ topic.content }}</p>
</div>

<div class="play-list-links">
  <ul class="l-stack-basic">
  {% for play in collections[topic.data.id + '-plays'] %}
  <li class="play-card">
    <a href="{{ play.url }}">{{ play.data.title }}</a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  {% if topic.data.related %}
  <h3>Related plays</h3>
  {%- for item in topic.data.related -%}
    <h4>{{ collections.topics[item].data.title }}</h4>
    <ul class="l-stack-basic">
     {%- for play in collections[item + '-plays'] -%}
        <li class="play-card">
          <a href="{{ play.url }}">{{ play.data.title }}</a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  {%- endfor -%}
  {% endif %}
</div>

</div>
{% endunless %}

{%- endfor -%}
</div>